  "description": "The Attain SL is the featherweight athlete of the Attain series - and arguably the most versatile, model, too. Featuring genuine race bike technology, it's the ideal choice for fast rides and long training sessions... and racing, of course. With comfort as standard and a lively, comfortable ride with surprisingly low weight, expect to find yourself clicking up through the gears and heading to the front of the bunch - it's that inspiring. Shimano's brand new 105 gears and rim brakes combine with the frame's superb ergonomics to put you in perfect control on every climb, descent and bend.",
